    {
      "type": "text",
      "name": "Introduction",
      "tag": "section",
      "box": {
        "y": 2031,
        "h": 467.8
      },
      "eyebrow": null,
      "heading": null,
      "body": [
        {
          "role": "Intro",
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Petley Jones Gallery has been a longstanding and dedicated partner in Blake Ward and Boky Hackel-Ward’s artistic journey for over a decade. Based in Vancouver’s South Granville arts district, the gallery has brought their sculpture to Canadian audiences through three landmark exhibitions, each marking a distinct chapter in the artists’ evolving practice.",
          "html": "<p>Petley Jones Gallery has been a longstanding and dedicated partner in Blake Ward and Boky Hackel-Ward’s artistic journey for over a decade. Based in Vancouver’s South Granville arts district, the gallery has brought their sculpture to Canadian audiences through three landmark exhibitions, each marking a distinct chapter in the artists’ evolving practice.</p>"
        }
      ],
      "media": [],
      "links": [],
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "role": "Intro",
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Petley Jones Gallery has been a longstanding and dedicated partner in Blake Ward and Boky Hackel-Ward’s artistic journey for over a decade. Based in Vancouver’s South Granville arts district, the gallery has brought their sculpture to Canadian audiences through three landmark exhibitions, each marking a distinct chapter in the artists’ evolving practice.",
          "html": "<p>Petley Jones Gallery has been a longstanding and dedicated partner in Blake Ward and Boky Hackel-Ward’s artistic journey for over a decade. Based in Vancouver’s South Granville arts district, the gallery has brought their sculpture to Canadian audiences through three landmark exhibitions, each marking a distinct chapter in the artists’ evolving practice.</p>",
          "font": {
